sequenceDiagram
  participant PAGE-INBOX
  participant API-TICKETS
  participant DB-USERS
  PAGE-INBOX->>+API-TICKETS: POST /tickets
  API-TICKETS->>+DB-USERS: Find owner
  DB-USERS-->>-API-TICKETS: Owner record
  Note over API-TICKETS,DB-USERS: Validate ownership
  alt Owner found
    API-TICKETS-->>PAGE-INBOX: 201 Created
  else No owner
    API-TICKETS-->>PAGE-INBOX: 404 Not found
  end
  deactivate API-TICKETS
